// EXPECT: [E086]
// A module constant has its DECLARED type at every use. The initialiser was returned in its own
// type and never converted: here a u16 1000 (a saturating cast the front end does not evaluate)
// became X, and `X as i32` read 1000 from a u8. The fold is now a checked conversion to the
// declared type, which the range analysis must discharge; 1000 does not fit a u8.
X u8 = 1000 as| u16
func main() i32 {
    return X as i32
}
